   3.997476403017524*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ca740479-86de-49e4-a91e-\
053ffa3d69d6"],

Cell["\<\
The 1D-MATH-EXTRACT test suite validates the framework\[CloseCurlyQuote]s \
data-extraction layer. It systematically proves that the internal extractor \
functions accurately and reliably isolate specific physical variables from \
the unified parameter sequence. By evaluating these extractors against a \
variety of constructed states, the suite ensures that the engine can \
seamlessly retrieve individual parameters\[LongDash]such as mass, position, \
or phase\[LongDash]from the core bus without corruption or indexing errors, \
guaranteeing a stable bridge between the raw data structures and the \
mathematical functions that rely on them.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.996754078987825*^9, {3.9967541735610743`*^9, 3.996754189662253*^9}, {
   3.99746107080628*^9, 
   3.997461076760602*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"38539ec9-ffce-4ada-8a40-\
60b43ca3c89e"],

